{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/2025/0606/c32178a3059270/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:55.138934+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/2025/0606/c32178a3059270/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>浙江大学软件学院成立于</span><span>2001</span><span>年</span><span>2</span><span>月，先后获批成为首批国家示范性软件学院、首批国家特色化示范性软件学院。在教育部第四轮学科评估中，我院软件工程学科获</span><span>A+</span><span>，在第五轮学科评估中保持优势，并入选全国双一流学科。</span></span></p><p><span>为展示学院和导师风采，让有志于攻读我院研究生的优秀大学生能够进一步认识浙江大学、了解浙江大学软件学院，为优秀大学生提供一个学术互动和交流学习的平台，我院将举办优秀大学生夏令营活动。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>一</span><span>.</span><span>申请对象</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.2026</span><span>年应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>申请电子信息专业的营员：信息类</span><span>(</span><span>软件工程、计算机科学、人工智能等</span><span>)</span><span>和数学类相关专业；</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请机械专业</span><span>(</span><span>工业设计工程</span><span>)</span><span>的营员：专业不限；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>学业成绩优秀、英语水平良好，有可能获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格的同学。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>二</span><span>.</span><span>申请办法</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>网上报名：即日起至</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日进入“</span></span><span><a href=\"https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>浙江大学研究生招生服务系统</span></span></a></span><span><span>”注册登录后进行报名，请在【项目制】处选择一个夏令营分营，限报一个分营，请慎重选择。各分营根据报名情况和容量确定各分营营员名单，</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>27</span><span>日左右在系统中公布，审核结果为通过的同学即为入选夏令营，并请加入钉钉群（通过系统或短信通知）。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>上传附件材料要求：以下材料务必按顺序组织成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档（命名方式：姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科院校），在报名系统提交成绩单处提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）前</span><span>5</span><span>学期成绩单和总评成绩在本专业</span></span><span> </span><span>(</span><span><span>同年级</span><span>)</span><span>排名（需加盖学校或院系成绩校核章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）个人简历；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）英语水平证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）其他材料：包括能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果、获奖证书等材料。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>分营信息</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>分营名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>分营简介</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>攻读专业</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>攻读类别</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>邮箱</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>数据引擎与工业软件</span></p></td><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/b3614350-95fd-4f4e-8e0d-1f97d08456b0.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>01数据引擎与工业软件分营介绍.pdf</span></a></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>冯尊磊</span></p></td><td><p><span>zunleifeng@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>先进计算与新兴软件</span></p></td><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/8b9f2c25-b5f7-4872-a326-2f898ee09b30.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">02先进计算与新兴软件分营介绍.pdf</a></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>李莹</span></p></td><td><p><span>cnliying@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/2025/0606/c32178a3059270/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>计算机系统与量子计算</span></a></p></td><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/7611ad3b-3708-486a-b850-b41743e857b6.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">03计算机系统与量子计算分营介绍.pdf</a> </p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>谭思危</span></p></td><td><p><span>siweitan@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>4</span></p></td><td><p><span>大模型与工业智能</span></p></td><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/5892c994-3425-40d7-824e-22cf71caf0c0.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">04大模型与工业智能分营简介.pdf</a></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>林彬彬</span></p></td><td><p><span>binbinlin@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>数据治理与数据挖掘</span></p></td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/d9f07622-8e75-4cfa-b680-bb5846262fe2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">05数据治理与数据挖掘分营简介0614更新.pdf</a></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>毛玉仁</span></p></td><td><p><span>yuren.mao@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6</span></p></td><td><p><span>数字孪生</span></p></td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/caf1b1fe-15eb-45f7-a88b-5566a6b1133e.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">06数字孪生分营简介.pdf</a></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>梁秀波</span></p></td><td><p><span>xiubo@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7</span></p></td><td><p><span>智能化软件工程</span></p></td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/957671eb-5356-4bb1-87d6-8f24c38ca5f2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">07智能化软件工程分营简介.pdf</a></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>不分硕博</span></p></td><td><p><span>才振功</span></p></td><td><p><span>cstcaizg@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8</span></p></td><td><p><span>智能设计</span></p></td><td><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/70/66/7432aa1f46dbbd0fe36af4e97293/b2085461-405b-4f61-b894-616fd3097ffd.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">08智能设计营分营简介.pdf</a></td><td><p><span>机械</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>姚琤</span></p></td><td><p><span>yaoch@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>在系统中填写报考信息时请注意：学位类别选专业学位，意向攻读类别和攻读专业见上表，意向导师可以不填</span><span>。</span></span><span> </span><br/></p><p><strong><span><span>三</span><span>.</span><span>活动时间与内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>夏令营活动安排在</span><span>7</span><span>月初至</span><span>7</span><span>月中旬进行，暑期夏令营有关活动内容主要采用网络远程方式进行（具体根据各分营安排）。各分营制订活动内容（包括相关介绍、系列学术讲座、项目训练、评选优秀营员等），详细安排将在钉钉群里通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四</span><span>.</span><span>深造机会</span></span></strong></p><p><span>能获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格的优秀大学生，将有机会参加我院推荐免试研究生的选拔，具体招生录取流程按照研究生院有关规定执行。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0574-88226657</span><span>、</span><span>88229858</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：毛老师、蔡老师</span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span><span>cszs@zju.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学软件学院</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"38bcc498ab367cdb2634a507a45de4815f011ce04452676edc03cebf09924a88","textLength":1420,"sourceSha256":"b6cdb1a82f86d80915cef957bd98b52ab81801b9b4f0ea11a4553d0ce4f83237","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c4b83660c9b8d5a04e43","title":"2025年浙江大学软件学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:55.138934+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cst.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/fed0b35e862594cf654a.gif"}]}
